ANIX development client

Usage: anix.exe [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  process         
  research        
  model           
  eval            
  project         
  question        
  source          
  paper           
  claim           
  hypothesis      
  experiment      
  finding         
  graph           
  evidence        
  gate            
  task            
  run             
  agent           
  timeline        
  research-state  
  projections     
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --workspace <WORKSPACE>  [default: .]
      --project <PROJECT>      
      --actor <ACTOR>          [default: cli-user]
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
